Object.assign(window.BODY=window.BODY||{},{"bf1": "<h2 id=\"第-1-法-前后引从升迁吉-进职迁宅\">第 1 法　前后引从升迁吉：进职迁宅</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　引干宜进职，引支宜迁宅</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"前后引从格-升官迁宅\">前后引从格：升官迁宅</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">夫前引后从格者有二等，如遇初传居干前为引、末传居干后为从，值此格者必升擢官职；又如初传居支前为引、末传居支后为从，值此格者必迁修家宅，二事皆吉。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 1 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　前引后从的格局分两类：一类是初传居于天干前为引、末传居于天干后为从，占得此格主官职升迁；另一类是初传居于地支前为引、末传居于地支后为从，占得此格主家宅迁移修葺。两者均为吉。此格为总述，下列各格皆其变格。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"拱贵格-官职升擢\">拱贵格：官职升擢</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">引从天干格内，如庚辰日寅加酉为初传、子加未为末传，此乃初末引从，庚干在内，干上丑为昼贵，兼三传下贼上，岂不应升擢官职也。夜占乃墓神覆日亦无畏，缘中传未作天乙冲破丑墓，乃为吉课也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 1 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　拱贵格属前引后从第一类，即初传居天干前、末传居天干后。例如庚辰日，寅加酉为初传、子加未为末传。庚干在内，干上丑是昼贵人，兼有初中末三传下贼上，应验提升官职。夜占就算墓神覆盖日干也不用怕，因中传未作天乙冲破丑墓。占得此格，主官职升迁。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚辰日　月将 亥 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 未 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：拱贵格 · 庚辰日昼占，干上丑乘昼贵，三传下贼上</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"两贵引从天干格-贵人提携\">两贵引从天干格：贵人提携</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">如壬子日，初传巳加子为昼贵，末传卯加戌为夜贵，亦是墓神覆日，赖中传之戌冲辰，不畏墓也。凡值此例，必得上人提携，或两处贵人引荐成事，如辰为月将尤妙也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 1 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　两贵引从天干格，譬如壬子日第八局。壬日昼贵在巳、夜贵在卯，壬寄亥宫。初传巳加子，巳为昼贵，居亥前为引；末传卯加戌，卯为夜贵，居亥后为从。昼夜两贵引从壬干，故称两贵引从天干格。另壬水以辰为墓神，辰临壬上为墓神覆日，但中传为戌，戌辰相冲，故不畏墓神。占得此格，主受贵人提携，或得两贵引荐而成事。若辰为月将，更吉。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬子日　月将 亥 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 戌 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：两贵引从格 · 壬子日昼占，初传巳乘昼贵、末传卯乘夜贵</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"初末引从地支格-迁修家宅\">初末引从地支格：迁修家宅</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">如己亥日，初传巳加子，末传卯加戌，亦系引从地支格。虽初末加其干墓覆支，赖中传之戌冲辰亦无畏，宜迁修家宅则吉。又如丁亥日，初传巳加子，末传卯加戌，亦初末引从地支格。奈昼夜天将皆是白虎居于支上，岂宜迁修宅舍乎？殊不知亦赖中传戌蛇冲辰虎，不为害也。如用辰为月将尤为妙也，或占人行年本命又居巳位，以巳上二戌冲辰，众凶皆散矣。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 1 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　初末引从地支格，如己亥日第八局，初传巳加子、末传卯加戌。巳居日支亥水之前为引，卯居日支亥水之后为从，故为初末引从地支格。虽初末加亥干墓覆盖地支，依仗中传的戌冲辰，也不用担心，宜于迁修家宅。（另丁亥日同格，支上乘白虎凶将，但中传戌乘腾蛇、戌冲辰，白虎不为害。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己亥日　月将 亥 加占时 午　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 戌 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：初末引从地支格 · 己亥日昼占，巳卯引从日支亥</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"昼夜贵人临干支上拱其年命在内者-告贵成事\">昼夜贵人临干支上拱其年命在内者：告贵成事</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">昼夜贵人临干支上拱其年命在内者，宜告贵用事，必得两贵人成就。如丁酉日酉加丁、亥加酉，占人年命在申；丁巳日亥加丁、酉加巳，占人年命在午；癸亥日巳加癸、卯加亥，占人年命在子。凡干支夹拱在下层，惟甲子、甲辰、癸亥、癸卯；在上层惟庚午、庚戌、丁巳、丁酉。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 1 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　昼夜贵人临于干支上，夹拱年命。如丁酉日第十一局，占人年命在申。丁日夜贵在酉，酉居日干丁上、居申前为引；昼贵在亥，亥居日支酉上、居申后为从。两贵夹拱年命申于其内。主宜告贵用事，必得两贵人成就。（下盘取夜占为例。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁酉日　月将 巳 加占时 卯　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 亥 → 丑</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：昼夜贵临干支拱年命申 · 丁酉日（下盘昼占示例）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"二贵拱年命格-告贵成事\">二贵拱年命格：告贵成事</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">如癸未日，初传巳加子，末传卯加戌，占人行年、本命在亥，宜告贵成事。名末助初财初德，亦贵人助贵人也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 1 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　二贵拱年命格，如癸未日第八局，占人行年、本命在亥。初传巳贵加子，居亥前为引；末传卯贵加戌，居亥后为从。占得此格，宜告贵成事。另外此课又是日德、日贵并妻财发用，日禄临支，末传助妻财，辰土官星临本命，故求财、求官皆吉，利于科考。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸未日　月将 亥 加占时 午　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 戌 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：二贵拱年命格 · 癸未日昼占，二贵夹拱年命亥</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"干支拱定日禄格-宜占前程\">干支拱定日禄格：宜占前程</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">惟伏吟卦为的。如丁巳、己巳、癸亥皆伏吟，宜占食禄事。癸亥为嫌禄空。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 1 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　此格均为伏吟课。如丁、己禄在午，丁巳、己巳两日占得伏吟课，干上乘未、支上乘巳，夹拱日禄午。癸禄在子，癸亥日占得伏吟课，干上乘丑、支上乘亥，夹拱日禄子。此课宜占食禄、前程之事。但癸亥日子水逢空，故称禄空，便不以此断。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁巳日　月将 巳 加占时 巳　（伏吟·自信）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 申 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：干支拱定日禄格 · 丁巳日伏吟，干支夹拱日禄午</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"干支拱夜贵昼贵格-告贵求事吉\">干支拱夜贵昼贵格：告贵求事吉</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">惟伏吟为的。如庚午、己酉支干拱夜贵，甲子支干拱昼贵，皆伏吟卦，宜告贵人求事。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 1 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　此格亦为伏吟课。如庚午日占，夜贵在未，伏吟课，庚上乘申、午上乘午，夹拱夜贵未；己酉日占，夜贵在申，己上乘未、酉上乘酉，夹拱夜贵申——两者为干支拱夜贵。甲子日占，昼贵在丑，伏吟课，甲上乘寅、子上乘子，夹拱昼贵丑，为干支拱昼贵。占得此格，宜告贵求事。（下盘取庚午日夜占示例。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚午日　月将 子 加占时 子　（伏吟·自任）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>申 → 寅 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：干支拱夜贵格 · 庚午日伏吟夜占，干支夹拱夜贵未</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"初中拱地盘贵人格-告贵成事\">初中拱地盘贵人格：告贵成事</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">如庚午日，干上戌，支上申，乃支干并初中拱夜贵也；又庚午日，干上酉，支上未；又庚午日，干上午、支上辰，乃支干初中皆拱地盘之夜贵，皆宜告贵而成合事。余皆仿此。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 1 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　初中拱地盘贵人格。如庚午日第十一局，夜贵在未，干上神戌、支上神申，初传申、中传戌，夹拱酉，酉对应地盘上为夜贵未。因此为干支并初中拱地盘之夜贵。占得此格，宜告贵成事。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚午日　月将 寅 加占时 子　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>申 → 戌 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：初中拱地盘贵人格 · 庚午日夜占，初中传夹拱地盘夜贵</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（官贵）：初末引从干支之前后，宜升职迁宅</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　初传居干（或支）之前为<q class=\"yw\">引</q>，末传居干（或支）之后为<q class=\"yw\">从</q>。</p>\n<p>⭐ 引干宜进职，引支宜迁宅；昼夜贵人拱年命主得贵人引荐、升擢官职。忌墓神覆日无冲救、忌空亡。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔贵人官禄〕</span>前后引从：日干或年命前后得贵神引从，主有人推挽、排列、护送。　<strong>用法</strong>：占官迁喜贵、禄、马旺而不空；常人可主贵人扶持或出行有伴。</p>\n<hr>", "bf2": "<h2 id=\"第-2-法-首尾相见始终宜-所谋皆成\">第 2 法　首尾相见始终宜：所谋皆成</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　攻必取，战必胜</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"周而复始格-占事必成\">周而复始格：占事必成</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓干上有旬尾，支上有旬首，名周而复始格，亦名一旬周遍格。凡值此者，占事不脱，所谋皆成。占赴试，宜代工；占讼，宜换司易局；占交加用事，去而复来。惟不宜占释散事，如有忧疑，其事尽在未能决断。惟乙未、辛丑、丙申、壬寅、戊申五日有之。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 2 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　“首尾相见”指干支上神为旬尾和旬首。干上神为旬尾、支上神为旬首，称周而复始格，又叫一旬周遍格。占得此格，事情不会失脱，谋划皆可成功。占考试宜代工应试；占诉讼宜改换衙门；事情多有交加、反复来去。只是不宜占释散忧疑之事，主事情不能决断。（干上旬尾支上旬首之日：乙未、辛丑、丙申、壬寅、戊申；干上旬首支上旬尾之日：乙丑、辛未、丙寅、戊寅、壬申。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙未日第 2 局　月将 辰 加占时 巳　（昴星·冬蛇掩目）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 卯 → 午</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：周而复始格 · 乙未日第二局，干上旬尾、支上旬首</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"天心格-事情远大\">天心格：事情远大</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">天心格乃年月日时皆在四课之内。凡占乃非常之事，即日而成，或干天庭之事，定然成就。如占阴私、常用邮俚之事，反成咎也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 2 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　天心格与回还格都由第二法衍生。天心格指年、月、日、时四者都在四课之中。占得此格，主事情远大、即日而成，或事关朝廷（天庭），必定有成。但若占阴私、常人鄙俚之事，反成灾祸。（此格视年月日时是否俱入四课而定，无定盘。）</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"回还格-吉凶成真\">回还格：吉凶成真</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">回还格乃三传在四课之中。如辛亥日，干上酉、亥上戌，三传戌酉申是也，此以不备言之。至于干支自作三合者，内多回还格，乃干支相会，不可作不备言之。如丁卯、丁亥、己卯、己亥，皆干上卯或干上亥，诸如此类占之。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 2 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　回还格指三传都在四课之中。如辛亥日，干上酉、支（亥）上戌，三传戌酉申，三传不出四课，故名回还。占吉事则吉事成真、占凶事则凶祸降临；事情只宜守旧，不宜有所动作；占病则疾病难愈，占讼则诉讼难解。（干支自作三合者亦多为回还格，如丁卯、丁亥、己卯、己亥。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛亥日　月将 辰 加占时 巳　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 酉 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：回还格 · 辛亥日，三传戌酉申俱在四课之中</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（官贵）：干上旬尾、支上旬首，攻取必胜、诸谋皆就</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　干上有旬尾、支上有旬首（周而复始格）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 攻必取、战必胜，凡谋皆就、去而复来；不宜占解散忧疑之事。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔贵人官禄〕</span>首尾夹定：课传首尾相应，事情有始有终，前后不脱节。　<strong>用法</strong>：首尾吉神生合则全程得助；首尾凶神夹克，则始终受制。</p>\n<hr>", "bf3": "<h2 id=\"第-3-法-帘幕贵人高甲第-考试必中\">第 3 法　帘幕贵人高甲第：考试必中</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　班超封万里之侯</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"帘幕格-试必高中\">帘幕格：试必高中</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">帘幕官者，如昼占乃夜贵，夜占乃昼贵。如占科目，专视此神，临于占人年命之上，或临日干上，试必高中矣。凡庶人占得帘幕，得林下官扶持。如有官人占得之，为休官之象。旬首作帘幕官者临年命、日干之上尤的，惟乙己辛日有之。又辰戌作旬首临年命、日干者必中魁元，乃甲辰、甲戌两旬二十日有之。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 3 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　帘幕贵人又称幕后贵人，是隐身在垂帘之后的贵人。古代科举设主考官及房官，位居贡院内幕门内，故称帘幕贵人。六壬中昼占得夜贵、夜占得昼贵，即为帘幕贵人。占科举专看此贵人。若帘幕贵人临行年、本命或日干之上，则必定高中；常人占得主有暗中相助者，为官者占得则为休官之象。旬首作帘幕贵人临年命、日干更验，只有乙、己、辛日有此格。另辰、戌作旬首而临行年、本命或日干，则主考试夺魁，甲辰旬、甲戌旬二十日有此格。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"斗鬼相加格-必中魁元\">斗鬼相加格：必中魁元</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">或丑加未，或未加丑作年命日干者，亦中魁元，缘丑有斗，未中有鬼，斗鬼二字合而为魁故也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 3 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　丑未相加、作年命或日干，亦主考试夺魁。因为以黄道十二宫而论，丑宫中有斗宿、未宫中有鬼宿，“斗”字与“鬼”字相加便是一个“魁”字，因此有此推断。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"亚魁星-试必高中\">亚魁星：试必高中</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">天魁星，天盘酉临年命日干者，占试必高中，缘酉为从魁也。以上诸说忌空亡。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 3 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　天魁星指天盘酉临年命、日干，占考试必高中，因为酉即从魁。无论帘幕贵人、丑未相加、还是酉临年命日干，都忌空亡——一旦旬空落空反而为凶，主考试落榜。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"德入天门格-考试高中\">德入天门格：考试高中</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">德入天门格乃日德加亥为用，士人占之必高中。亥为天门，德者得也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 3 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日德加亥发用，亥为天门，为德入天门格。占得此格，考试必定高中。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"真朱雀格-文合上意\">真朱雀格：文合上意</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">真朱雀格，如六己日于四季年占，用夜贵逆布，乃朱雀乘午。占春闱，其文贴上意，必得高中。缘朱雀主文书，生太岁又生日干。如真朱雀克太岁，占讼必达朝廷，罪必致死，惟申酉岁的。朱雀乘神克帘幕官，占试其文，不贴主文意。朱雀乘丁马，榜将出，忌。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 3 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　朱雀本位是丙午火位，如再乘午火是归本家，称为真朱雀格。例如四季年、六己日夜占，贵人逆布，朱雀乘午，占春闱主文章符贴上意，必定高中。朱雀主文书，生太岁又生日干，故作此推断。（申、酉年占，真朱雀克太岁，占讼则主达朝廷之上、犯罪必定致死；朱雀乘神克帘幕贵人，占考试文章不合考官心意；朱雀乘丁马、榜将出时，忌占得此格。）</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"昼夜贵人拱年命者-赴试必中\">昼夜贵人拱年命者：赴试必中</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">昼夜贵人拱年命者，赴试必中。如丁酉日干上酉、支上亥，占人年命在申，大宜占试。缘干支上神作昼夜贵人拱年命上河魁。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 3 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　昼夜贵人拱年命，主考试高中。此例与第一法“昼夜贵人临干支拱年命者”相近，不同在于：此例拱的是天盘上年命，前例拱地盘上年命。例如丁酉日第十一局，年命在申，干上神为夜贵酉、支上神为昼贵亥，酉亥夹拱年命申上神戌。宜考试，因干支上神作昼夜贵人拱护行年本命上的河魁。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁酉日第 11 局　月将 巳 加占时 卯　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 亥 → 丑</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：昼夜贵人拱年命 · 丁酉日第十一局，酉亥夹拱天盘年命</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"源消根断格-终成劳瘵\">源消根断格：终成劳瘵</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">源消根断格，如癸卯日，干上卯、支上巳，年命在寅，大宜占试，不在此论。缘只取二贵拱年命也，但高中矣，恐以不摄终成劳瘵。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 3 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　癸卯日第十一局，干上神卯、支上神巳，年命在寅，宜于占试。但四课均为上神脱下神，干支为连续脱泄，故称源消根断格。虽然获得高中，但难享富贵；或者虽然富贵，却难以久长。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸卯日第 11 局　月将 巳 加占时 卯　（遥克·蒿矢）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 酉 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：源消根断格 · 癸卯日第十一局，四课上神脱下神、连续脱泄</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"帘幕贵人的喜畏-不喜墓空\">帘幕贵人的喜畏：不喜墓空</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">帘幕贵人尤分喜畏，细具于后。甲日不喜未墓为之，庚日不喜丑墓为之。又甲寅日不喜丑空为之，庚寅日不喜未空为之，丙寅、丁卯日不喜亥空为之，己卯、乙亥日不喜申空为之，壬子、癸丑日不喜卯空为之，壬寅、癸卯日不喜巳空为之，六辛日不喜午克为之。又辛亥日不喜寅空为之。空亡尤甚，使试官置卷不视，徒劳一次。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 3 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　墓指甲日见未、庚日见丑，未丑旺相则为库、死囚则为墓。空指帘幕贵人逢旬空：甲寅、戊午、庚申日丑贵空；甲申、戊子、庚寅日未贵空；丙寅、丁卯日亥贵空；乙卯、己未日子贵空；乙亥、己卯日申贵空；壬子、癸丑日卯贵空；壬寅、癸卯日巳贵空；辛亥日寅贵空；辛卯日午贵空。帘幕贵人逢墓、逢空，犹如考试官将试卷搁置不阅，主考试不中、徒劳无功。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"占武举法-武举的推断\">占武举法：武举的推断</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">占武举法，以巳为弓弩，申为矢箭。申加午必箭中红心。如申加寅、申、巳、亥为四脚花，以第几课发用言其箭中之数。四墓脱垛。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 3 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　古代武举考射箭、马术。巳为弓弩、申为矢箭。申加午主箭中红心；申加寅、申、巳、亥为四脚花，以第几课发用来推断射中的数目；加四墓则主脱垛（脱靶）。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（官贵）：昼占夜贵、夜占昼贵临身命，应试高中</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　昼占得夜贵、夜占得昼贵，临于年命或日干之上。</p>\n<p>⭐ 应试必高中；旬首或辰戌作旬首临命尤验。忌空亡（使试官置卷不视）。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔贵人官禄〕</span>帘幕贵人：昼夜贵人之间的帘幕之神，主考选、幕僚、文职和科名。　<strong>用法</strong>：临年命日干、乘朱雀青龙而得地，利文试求名；空破则虚名。</p>\n<hr>", "bf4": "<h2 id=\"第-4-法-催官使者赴官期-催官赴任\">第 4 法　催官使者赴官期：催官赴任</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　惟将赴任宜见</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"催官使者-从速赴任\">催官使者：从速赴任</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">凡占上官赴任，见日鬼乘白虎加临日干或年命之上，乃名催官使者，纵是远缺，必催速赴任也。如催官使者空亡，又是虚信，或被遣差。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 4 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　占上官赴任，见日鬼乘白虎加临日干或年命之上，称为催官使者，即使是远缺也必主催促快速赴任。若催官使者空亡，则主为虚信或被遣差。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"催官符-催官赴任\">催官符：催官赴任</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">催官符，如官星临日干年命者，其三传上神生其官星是也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 4 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　催官符指的是官星临日干、年命，三传上神生官星的格局。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"恩主举荐例-贵人举荐\">恩主举荐例：贵人举荐</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">恩主举荐例传，年、日、辰有父母爻者是，亦为食禄之地，如值长生作贵人亦如之。如乙日见日贵为父母，己日见夜贵为长生。外乙卯日昼贵空，己卯日夜贵空不用。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 4 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　父母为生我之神，课传得之主有人举荐。值长生、作贵人亦作此推断。如乙日见日贵子（子水生乙木）为父母；己日见夜贵申（申为己之长生）。空亡则无力——乙卯日子水空亡、己卯日申空亡，则主举荐无力。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"四时返本煞-赴任极迟\">四时返本煞：赴任极迟</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">四时返本煞，占赴任极迟。夫返本煞者，春得金局，夏得水局，秋得火局，冬得土局是也。如赴任占得返吟，多不满任。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 4 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　四时返本煞指春占得金局（金绝于春）、夏占得水局（水绝于夏）、秋占得火局（火死于秋）、冬占得土局（土死于冬）。为身旺官衰之象，官气不旺，故主赴任极迟。若占赴任得返吟课，多主不满任。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（官贵）：日鬼乘白虎临干命，催速赴任</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日鬼乘白虎加临日干或年命之上。</p>\n<p>⭐ 纵是远缺亦催促速赴任；若逢空亡则为虚信或被差遣。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔贵人官禄〕</span>催官使者：魁罡、驿马、天马等催动官事，主任命、赴任、迁调迅速。　<strong>用法</strong>：利求官赴任；常人见鬼马逼身，可主官事催迫。</p>\n<hr>", "bf5": "<h2 id=\"第-5-法-六阳数足须公用-利于公干\">第 5 法　六阳数足须公用：利于公干</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　随六三，系丈夫，失小子，随有求得，利居贞，扬兵于九天之上</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"六阳格-公事吉而私事凶\">六阳格：公事吉而私事凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">六阳格，谓支干四课三传皆居六阳之位是也。凡占皆利公干而不利私谋。假令庚子日第一课戌加庚，第二课子加戌，第三课寅加子，第四课辰加寅作初传。其中传午加辰，末传申加午，卦名登三天，宜占天庭事，有动达高尊之象。如君子占之稍畏初中空亡而减力。如常人占之，赖初中空却省力也，尤未免公干，明白事理。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 5 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　四课、三传皆居六阳位为六阳格。占得此格利于公干、不利私谋。例如庚子日第十一局，四课分别为戌庚、子戌、寅子、辰寅，三传为辰午申，四课上神及三传均为阳神，六阳动达如登三天，故称登三天卦，公事吉而私事凶，宜占朝廷之事。为官者占得此格，若初、中传空亡其力稍减；常人占得初、中传空亡，反而主办事省力。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚子日第 11 局　月将 巳 加占时 卯　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 午 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：六阳格（登三天卦）· 庚子日第十一局，四课三传皆阳位</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"悖戾格-事情艰难\">悖戾格：事情艰难</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">悖戾格亦名倒拔蛇，如甲午日干上子，虽四课三传皆处六阳之地。缘三传退间，主事间阻艰难，兼被初传戌财引入中末鬼乡，凡占事皆艰辛，尤不免公用也。如甲戌日干上子，四课三传亦皆处六阳位，以上是自夜传出昼，尤明白。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 5 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　悖戾格又称倒拔蛇，例如甲午日第三局，四课为子甲、戌子、辰午、寅辰，三传戌申午，四课三传虽皆为阳为六阳，但因三传退间，故主有所阻碍、事情艰难。再加初传戌为妻财、中传申为官鬼，故占事皆艰辛，尤其不利公事。再如甲戌日第三局，四课三传皆为阳、三传退间，亦作如上推断。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲午日第 3 局　月将 卯 加占时 巳　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 子 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>戌→申→午</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>寅→子→戌</strong>（涉害；分歧类型：<strong>涉害深浅</strong>）。 原书注：悖戾格（倒拔蛇）· 甲午日第三局，六阳而三传退间</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"五阳格-利公不利私\">五阳格：利公不利私</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">五阳格，课传居五阳之上者，或占人年命填之，亦名六阳，事主公用明白，利公不利私也。此例极多，不暇细具。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 5 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　五阳格，四课三传有五位属阳，再加行年、本命属阳，亦为六阳，事理明白，利于公而不利私。此例极多，不做赘述。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（刑墓）：课传皆居六阳之位，利公干不利私谋</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　支干四课三传皆居六阳之位。</p>\n<p>⭐ 利公干而不利私谋；有动达高尊之象，君子畏初中空亡减力。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔阴阳动静〕</span>六阳数足：阳神足、贵人顺行，主公开、进取、君子、公事。　<strong>用法</strong>：占官事、公务、男子进取较宜；过阳无阴则急进少藏。</p>\n<hr>", "bf6": "<h2 id=\"第-6-法-六阴相继尽昏迷-昏迷虚耗\">第 6 法　六阴相继尽昏迷：昏迷虚耗</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　随六二，系小子，失丈夫。伏兵于九地之下</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"六阴格-昏迷之象\">六阴格：昏迷之象</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">六阴格，谓课传皆居六阴之位是也。凡占利阴谋私干，不利公闻，尤尽昏迷也，或自昼传夜昏迷愈甚。如己卯日第一课酉加己，第二课亥加酉作初传，第三课巳加卯，第四课未加巳。中传丑加亥，末传卯加丑，课名溟蒙。凡占事必是阴谋奸私之象，兼天将天后、腾蛇、六合、元武，支干上皆乘盗气，又是弹射发用坐于空乡，至费力而不可言也，占病必死，求望皆为脱耗。又己亥日干上巳同。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 6 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　六阴格指四课、三传皆居六阴之位。占得六阴格，利于阴谋私干、不利公事，有昏迷之象，自昼传夜昏迷更甚。例如己卯日第十一局，四课为酉己、亥酉、巳卯、未巳，三传亥丑卯，六阴朦昧似坠深渊，称为溟蒙格。占事为阴谋奸私之象，再加天将天后、腾蛇、六合、玄武，支干上皆乘盗气，而且又是弹射发用、坐于空乡，做事尤其费力，占病必死，求望皆为脱耗。己亥日第三局也是如此。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己卯日第 11 局　月将 寅 加占时 子　（遥克·弹射）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>亥 → 丑 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：六阴格（溟蒙格）· 己卯日第十一局夜占，四课三传皆阴位</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"五阴格-利私不利公\">五阴格：利私不利公</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">五阴格，课传止五阴者，占人年命填之。凡占利私不利公，利小人不利君子。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 6 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　五阴格指四课、三传五位属阴。如果行年、本命属阴，则填为六阴，占事利私不利公，利小人而不利君子。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"源消根断格-事皆虚耗\">源消根断格：事皆虚耗</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">源消根断格，如癸卯、癸未、癸巳，干上卯，课传俱在五阴之位，又是下生上神，迤逦而脱去。占病缘不摄而致病，岂不危绝乎？凡占皆脱耗，其法如神，切宜秘之。又如辛卯日干上子，自干至支及初中末，迤逦下生上神，尽被脱盗，虽不系五阴位全，其理一同。以上例除占病外，诸占未免脱耗，日渐消铄也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 6 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　源消根断格，如癸卯日第十一局、癸未日、癸巳日第十一局，四课三传俱在阴位、四课都是下生上，占病主不能进食而致病，十分凶险，占得此格皆主脱耗。又如辛卯日第十一局，四课三传皆下神生上神、尽是脱盗之气，虽非全阴位，除占病外其占断之理与上例相近，占事未免虚耗。（此格亦见第三法，彼处论考试劳瘵，此处论占病脱耗。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸卯日第 11 局　月将 巳 加占时 卯　（遥克·蒿矢）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 酉 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：源消根断格 · 癸卯日第十一局，四课下生上、连续脱盗</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（刑墓）：课传皆居六阴之位，主阴谋私干、昏迷</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　课传皆居六阴之位。</p>\n<p>⭐ 利阴谋私干、不利公闻，尽昏迷；自昼传夜昏迷愈甚，占病必死、求望皆脱耗。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔阴阳动静〕</span>六阴相继：阴神层层相继，主暗昧、迟滞、妇女、私情、昏沉。　<strong>用法</strong>：占病忌深阴入墓；占私事则可主隐情深藏。</p>\n<hr>", "bf7": "<h2 id=\"第-7-法-旺禄临身徒妄作-谋为省力\">第 7 法　旺禄临身徒妄作：谋为省力</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　不战而屈人之兵</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旺禄临身格-不可他谋\">旺禄临身格：不可他谋</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓日之禄神，又作日之旺神，临于干上者，切不可舍此而别谋动作。如乙卯日干上卯，幸得乘日之旺禄，何不守此，乃舍而就初传之财、中末之生，殊不知皆是旬内空亡，既逢干空，不免啰唝，再归干上就禄就旺，诚所谓「到处去来，不如在此</q>之语也。又乙酉、乙亥日干上卯，癸巳、癸丑日干上子，辛卯、辛丑、辛酉日干上酉，己亥、己酉、己巳日干上午，虽不系己土旺神，亦可用也。」 <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 7 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　禄神为日禄（日干临官之处），旺神为日旺（帝旺之处）。日禄又作旺神、加于日干之上，千万不可舍此而另有谋求、动作。例如乙卯日第二局，此课虽初传为财、末传长生，但初中传旬空、末传坐空皆为空虚，不可去就，而应守干上卯木之禄。占得此课，主自在坐用、谋为省力，不必他求。（乙酉、乙亥、癸巳、癸丑、辛卯、辛丑、辛酉、己亥、己酉、己巳等日第二局亦作如上推断；另辛巳日、癸亥日旺禄逢空反不宜守，乙未日三传戌卯午成闭口课主守家受困。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙卯日第 2 局　月将 辰 加占时 巳　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>丑 → 子 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：旺禄临身格 · 乙卯日第二局，日禄卯临干、宜守不宜他谋</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"禄被元夺格-另作推断\">禄被元夺格：另作推断</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">禄被元夺格，如辛卯日，干上酉为日旺禄，缘昼乘元而夜乘虎，遂不可守。未免投初传丑，又是日墓，中传子又是脱气，末传又是丁亥乘虎而遥伤日干，自末传至干，虽欠一位，终不能复投其旺禄也。此例尚有，皆在钤内，甚详。又辛未日干上酉，夜乘虎，支上午火，初巳、中归巳乡，末丁卯。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 7 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　禄被元夺格，例如辛卯日第二局，三传丑子亥。夜占干上酉禄乘玄武、昼占乘白虎，皆为凶将，不可守。三传丑子亥会北方水局，为干墓又为脱气，皆不能守，也为暗昧不遂之课。又如辛未日第二局，亦作此断。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛卯日第 2 局　月将 辰 加占时 巳　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>丑 → 子 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：禄被元夺格 · 辛卯日第二局，日禄酉乘玄武/白虎被夺</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（财运）：日禄又作旺神临干，守此勿他谋</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日之禄神又作日之旺神，临于干上。</p>\n<p>⭐ 切不可舍此别谋（到处去来不如在此）；若旺禄旬空则所得不偿所费，反宜弃禄就三传之财。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔贵人官禄〕</span>旺禄临身：日禄旺相临身已有所得，再妄求反易破坏现成禄位。　<strong>用法</strong>：宜守成享禄，不宜无度扩张；禄受冲破时先保本位。</p>\n<hr>", "bf8": "<h2 id=\"第-8-法-权摄不正禄临支-受制于人\">第 8 法　权摄不正禄临支：受制于人</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　不为邻国之游士，亦作幕府之客臣</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"日禄临支格-权摄不正\">日禄临支格：权摄不正</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓日干禄神加临支辰上者，凡占不自尊大，受屈折于他人。如占差遣，主权摄不正，或遥授职禄，或正宜食宅上之禄；或将本身之职禄替于儿男者，斯占尤的。且此例每日有一课，可逐类而言之。假令甲子日寅加子，乙丑日卯加丑之类，不暇细具，皆仿此。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 8 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日干禄神加临支辰之上，占事不能自己做主、受制于他人。六壬法以干代表己方、以支代表他方或他事。日干之禄临于支（他人或宅）上，非自行摄受，隐喻为有名无实。又禄临于宅上，也表安身甘居食宅上之禄，或本身之禄由家人、他人顶替之意。此例每日均有一课，例如甲子日第十一局寅加子、乙丑日第十一局卯加丑等与此格相似。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 11 局　月将 巳 加占时 卯　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 午 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：日禄临支格 · 甲子日第十一局，日禄寅加临日支子上</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"禄被支墓克脱-因宅失禄\">禄被支墓克脱：因宅失禄</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">禄被支墓克脱，外有日干之禄加支上，被支辰墓其禄，或被支克其禄神者，必因起盖房宅而失其禄。或被支辰脱其禄神者，必因起盖房宅而以禄偿债。假令辛丑日，酉加丑，乃禄神受墓。又乙酉日卯加酉，乃禄神受宅克。乙巳日卯加巳，乃禄神受脱。此例极多，不暇细具，余仿此。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 8 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　禄被支墓克脱指日禄加支上，支辰为禄之墓神、或支克日禄，主因起盖房宅而失禄；或者日禄受支辰脱，主因起盖房宅而以禄偿债。辛丑日第五局酉加丑，为禄神受墓的格局（下盘）；乙酉日第七局卯加酉，为禄神受宅克的格局；乙巳日第三局卯加巳，为禄神受脱的格局。此例课体极多。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛丑日第 5 局　月将 亥 加占时 卯　（知一）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 丑 → 酉</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：禄被支墓 · 辛丑日第五局，日禄酉加支丑受墓</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（财运）：禄神临支辰，受屈于人、权摄不正</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日干禄神加临支辰之上。</p>\n<p>⭐ 凡占不自尊大、受屈折于人；主权摄不正、遥授职禄，或以己禄替于儿男。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔贵人官禄〕</span>权摄不正：禄临支而不就干，权位偏于他人或暂代，名位不正。　<strong>用法</strong>：占职位主代理、借权、权在彼方；支生干尚得其利，支克干则受制。</p>\n<hr>", "bf9": "<h2 id=\"第-9-法-避难逃生须弃旧-难中受生\">第 9 法　避难逃生须弃旧：难中受生</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　四面受敌，亦有无敌之处</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"避难逃生格-避克害就生护\">避难逃生格：避克害就生护</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">避难逃生格，如甲子日戌加子作初传，虽曰日财，乃是旬空。中传申金又是日鬼。末传午火作日之脱气。且三传既无所益，不免只就干上子水而受生，乃应避难而逃生之语也。丁卯日干上亥，乙亥日干上酉，戊寅日干上申，庚戌日干上午，辛未日干上丑，戊午日干上辰，己巳日干上酉，辛酉日干上亥，壬申日干上寅，庚辰日干上子。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 9 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　当三传值财空、禄空、鬼杀、脱气等无益，即弃之而就干、支上之神相生者，称之为避难逃生。避开克我、害我之神即<q class=\"yw\">避难</q>，逃向生我、护我之神即<q class=\"yw\">逃生</q>。原则上此格宜乘吉将、忌乘凶将。如甲子日第三局，戌加子作初传，戌虽为日财但旬空，中传申金为日鬼，末传午火为日之脱气，三传皆无益，只好避开三传、就干上子水而受生，故此格称<q class=\"yw\">避难逃生</q>格。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 3 局　月将 卯 加占时 巳　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 申 → 午</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：避难逃生格 · 甲子日第三局，三传无益、就干上子水受生</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"避难逃生而终不能逃生者-四面受敌\">避难逃生而终不能逃生者：四面受敌</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">避难逃生而终不能逃生者，例如丁亥日干上戌，夜占昴星，三传午戌寅。缘始弃干上之墓，遂投初传之禄，奈是旬空，不免弃空禄而再归干上中传戌墓，终不可受，其久困又投末之长生，奈值白虎，未免止居宅中，受惊危之长生尔。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 9 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　课传中虽有长生可就，但上乘白虎、勾陈等恶将，虽受其生却担惊受怕、提心吊胆，终不安稳，是虽逃生终不能生之意。如丁亥日第十局，丁干乘戌、亥支乘寅，三传午戌寅。因丁干上戌土为墓，弃之而投初传午禄，午禄无用；复投中传，中传为墓，只好再投末传寅木。寅木虽是干之长生、又居宅上本为吉，但夜占上乘白虎恶将，只好居宅受其惊危。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁亥日第 10 局　月将 午 加占时 卯　（昴星·冬蛇掩目）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 戌 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：避难逃生而终不能逃生者 · 丁亥日第十局，长生乘白虎受惊危</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"避难逃生得财格-避难求财\">避难逃生得财格：避难求财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">避难逃生得财格，如壬午日，辰加亥作初传，乃是墓神覆日为用。三传辰酉寅，不免弃墓而投中传酉金之生，又是旬空，遂再投末传寅木，又是脱气，然后弃其三传，而壬干加午而取财也。如丙寅日寅加丙，申财加亥乘元，三传亥申巳，缘申见在之财落空，又焉能求外来之财也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 9 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　避难逃生得财格，如壬午日第八局，辰加亥作初传，是墓神覆日为用，三传辰酉寅，中传旬空、末传落空且脱日，均为不吉。弃其三传，壬水寄宫亥水临午财、且为日支。若占求财，反可得，故曰避难求财。占其他事情则不以此论。如占宅，亥水临支克午，是尊长凌卑小之象，反不吉。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬午日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 酉 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：避难逃生得财格 · 壬午日第八局，弃三传就干上午财</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"舍益就损格-不受福德\">舍益就损格：不受福德</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">舍益就损格，亦名不受福德，贲初九：「贲其趾，舍车而徒。</q>如壬寅日不就干上之申金为长生，愿以壬干加寅木而受脱。」 <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 9 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　舍益就损格，又称为不受福德。舍益就损即是追求微小利益，反将失去更可贵的东西，如同为了显示美丽的脚趾甘愿舍坐车徒步行走一样，故不可好高骛远。如壬寅日第四局，壬水不就干上申之长生，加寅木之上而受脱。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬寅日第 4 局　月将 巳 加占时 申　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 寅 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：舍益就损格 · 壬寅日第四局，舍申长生就寅木受脱</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"舍就皆不可格-舍就不成\">舍就皆不可格：舍就不成</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">舍就皆不可格，如乙酉日干上亥，辛丑日干上未，唯有庚子日干上辰乃空亡，庚午日干上戌乃空亡。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 9 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　舍就皆不可格，如乙酉日第六局，干上亥、乙（辰）又加支受脱；辛丑日第四局，干上未、辛（戌）加支丑受刑；只有庚子日第五局干上辰乃是空亡、庚午日第十一局干上戌乃是空亡。皆是舍之不可、就之亦不成之课。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙酉日第 6 局　月将 子 加占时 巳　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>亥 → 午 → 丑</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：舍就皆不可格 · 乙酉日第六局，干上亥加支受脱</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"墓作太阳格-上人提携\">墓作太阳格：上人提携</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">墓作太阳格，谓墓神覆日，却作太阳，处难中得上人提携，共有五等：一、就干上之生，二、就支上之生，三、日干坐地盘之生，四、本命乘丁坐地盘长生，五、日干下临财乡。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 9 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　墓神覆日虽是不吉之象，但如果墓神作月将（太阳），却主患难中有人提携。如前例壬午日第八局，辰土墓鬼覆日干壬水，若辰为月将便属此格。综上，避难逃生可分五种：就干上而生、就支上而生、日干坐地盘而生、本命乘丁坐地盘长生、日干下临财乡。（此格视墓神是否作月将而定，无定盘。）</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（鬼贼）：三传无益，就干支上受生以避难逃生</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　三传无所益（财空、鬼克、脱气），日干就干上或支上神受生。</p>\n<p>⭐ 应避难逃生、弃旧就新（四面受敌亦有无敌之处）；忌舍益就损。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔凶中取救〕</span>避难逃生：旧处被鬼克墓绝，新处有长生德合，弃旧换地方能脱险。　<strong>用法</strong>：三传向生方转化时宜变通；生方空亡则只是逃意而无生路。</p>\n<hr>", "bf10": "<h2 id=\"第-10-法-朽木难雕别作为-改科易业\">第 10 法　朽木难雕别作为：改科易业</h2>\n<h3 id=\"朽木难雕格-求谋不遂\">朽木难雕格：求谋不遂</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓斫轮课中，卯为空亡者，故名朽木不可雕也。凡值此例，宜改科易业而别作营生。如庚戌日卯加申、辛亥日卯加辛，此二者尤的，余有癸丑日卯加申发用。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 10 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　斫轮课中，卯木为车轮、申酉金为斧。木欲成器需用金斫，但若卯木逢空亡便为朽木，故谓朽木不可雕。朽木难以成器，宜改科易业、做其他营生。例如庚戌日第六局卯加申、辛亥日第八局卯加辛两局尤其如此，其他还有癸丑日第六局。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚戌日第 6 局　月将 子 加占时 巳　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 巳 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：朽木难雕格 · 庚戌日第六局，卯木加申而卯逢空</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"斧斤不利格-求谋不遂\">斧斤不利格：求谋不遂</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">斧斤不利格，如丁丑日卯加申为发用，乃申酉空亡，卯木加空地，非朽木难雕之例也，凡谋不遂。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 10 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　斧斤不利格，如丁丑日第六局，卯加申为发用、申酉空亡。此课局中尽管卯木加空亡之地，但不属朽木难雕格，而为斧斤不利格（斧斤即申酉金空、无法斫木）。占课得此，主求谋不遂。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁丑日第 6 局　月将 子 加占时 巳　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 戌 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：斧斤不利格 · 丁丑日第六局，卯加申而申酉空</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（鬼贼）：课中卯木空亡，宜改科易业、别作营生</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　课中卯木作空亡（朽木不可雕）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 宜改科易业、别作营生；卯加空地（斧斤不利）则凡谋不遂。</p>\n<hr>"});